[[34m2026-06-15 07:28:52[0m]   -> Bidirectional cross-attention between views: each view attends to the other view’s tokens, then features are combined for the rest of the encoder/decoder. Strong when views are aligned but not identical.
[[34m2026-06-15 07:28:52[0m] view_in=4, view_mixing_strategy=embedding
